00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.760
What makes a chicken Parm good?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.840
Well, I've learned over the years

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.370
that you need crisp, you need cheesy,

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.270
you need saucy, you need chickeny,

00:00:56.270 --> 00:00:57.920
and you need a little bit of sog.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.410
I don't understand chicken Parmesan.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:01.760
I just appreciate it.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.030
I would appreciate it

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:05.740
if you were to create a larger version

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.800
