00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.850
Normally, it's still pretty big portions,

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.350
but if you were to make it

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.550
big, make it big. (laughs)

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:19.850
- All right, thank you, Andrew,

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:23.050
