the invigorating challenge.

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:25.240
We're gonna start hammering some chicken.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:27.370
So we have a lot of chicken breasts here,

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:30.440
plastic wrap, chicken breasts,
weapon of obliteration.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.273
Here we go.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.310
This is oddly therapeutic.

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.330
And because this is gonna
be a large chicken Parm,

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:40.900
I don't want to pound it out too thin

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.550
