00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.540
Thank you for them for
saving my arms and my hands.

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.700
And now we play a little
bit of chicken Tetris.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.860
So the goal of this game,
'cause I like games,

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:18.164
