00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:39.130
the chicken stick to each other.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:43.800
Trying to use these almost
as indentations for nails.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.880
Well, during this aggressive
meat physical session,

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.330
we created some holes,

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:50.850
