00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.400
so we're gonna use these as our backup,

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.723
probably one over here, and away we go.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.600
All right, this is the end of the massage.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.100
You gotta smooth things out.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:03.360
We gave it the beating,

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:06.010
